[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4554592014","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4554592014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4554592014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABD3mPDg","user":{"login":"suryaKommana2662","id":281909823,"node_id":"U_kgDOEM2aPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281909823?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662","html_url":"https://github.com/suryaKommana2662","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suryaKommana2662/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T12:41:21Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T12:41:21Z","body":"Thanks for the report and the reproducible sample. I verified that the reproduces in debug mode on Flutter 3.44.0, while release mode does not appear to be affected. Since the issue includes clear reproduction steps, logs, and a reproducible sample, routing this to the `team-framework` for further investigation.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4554592014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4558097879","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4558097879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4558097879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABD68N1w","user":{"login":"davidhicks980","id":59215665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjE1NjY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59215665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980","html_url":"https://github.com/davidhicks980","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T19:46:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T19:46:00Z","body":"This is an interesting issue, and seems to be related to the tooltip proxy and the OverlayPortal's deferred layout. This is probably due to Tooltip adopting OverlayPortal in the most recent update. I'm not sure if it is common to show a tooltip while dragging, but I also am not sure if there's a way to disable the tooltip while dragging.\n\n@kwhite-sdi if this is blocking anything, here's a quick workaround that seems to work:\n\n```dart\n @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return ReorderableListView.builder(\n      buildDefaultDragHandles: false,\n      itemCount: items.length,\n      onReorderEnd: (index) {\n        Tooltip.dismissAllToolTips();\n      },\n      itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n        final config = items[index];\n        return ReorderableDragStartListener(\n          key: ValueKey(items[index]),\n          index: index,\n          child: Tooltip(\n            message: 'test $index',\n            child: ListTile(title: Text(config)),\n          ),\n        );\n      },\n      onReorderItem: (int oldIndex, int newIndex) {\n        setState(() {\n          final item = items.removeAt(oldIndex);\n          items.insert(newIndex, item);\n        });\n      },\n    );\n  }\n```\n\nThis appears to work even with long exit durations. Alternatively, you could insert an Overlay in the proxy decoration to separate the MenuAnchor overlay from the Tooltip overlay.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4558097879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4563954273","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4563954273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4563954273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABEAhqYQ","user":{"login":"kwhite-sdi","id":128485412,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6iIJA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128485412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi","html_url":"https://github.com/kwhite-sdi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T12:26:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T12:26:10Z","body":"Thank you for the quick reply.\n\nUnfortunatley, the workaround does not seem to be working all the time. After (quickly) dragging items multiple times the error eventually occurs.\n\nThe alternative sounds interesting, but I have no idea how that could be achieved.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4563954273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4571217958","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4571217958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4571217958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABEHdAJg","user":{"login":"davidhicks980","id":59215665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjE1NjY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59215665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980","html_url":"https://github.com/davidhicks980","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T05:55:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T05:59:03Z","body":"@kwhite-sdi Sorry that didn't work! Here's the overlay solution I was thinking of. Let me know if that works. If not, I'll see if I can think up something else. Also, everything within the animated builder is just a copy of the default proxy builder -- the only part that actually fixes the bug is the Overlay and OverlayEntry. In other words, feel free to modify the appearance of everything within the animated builder. It shouldn't affect the fix.\n\nAlso, I _think_ this is a non-issue, but the tooltip shown while dragging is being painted outside the bounds of its child. Since we set the clip behavior to none, it still is painted, so I don't think this has any practical effect on users. It's not an \"ideal\" solution, but it should work and appears to address the fundamental issue causing the error.\n\n\n```dart\n@override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return ReorderableListView.builder(\n      buildDefaultDragHandles: false,\n      itemCount: items.length,\n      proxyDecorator: (child, index, animation) {\n        return Overlay(\n          alwaysSizeToContent: true,\n          clipBehavior: .none,\n          initialEntries: [\n            OverlayEntry(\n              canSizeOverlay: true,\n              builder: (context) {\n                return AnimatedBuilder(\n                  animation: animation,\n                  builder: (BuildContext context, Widget? child) {\n                    final double animValue = Curves.easeInOut.transform(animation.value);\n                    final double elevation = ui.lerpDouble(0, 6, animValue)!;\n                    return Material(elevation: elevation, child: child);\n                  },\n                  child: child,\n                );\n              },\n            ),\n          ],\n        );\n      },\n      itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n        final config = items[index];\n        return ReorderableDragStartListener(\n          key: ValueKey(items[index]),\n          index: index,\n          child: Tooltip(\n            message: 'test $index',\n            child: ListTile(title: Text(config)),\n          ),\n        );\n      },\n      onReorderItem: (int oldIndex, int newIndex) {\n        setState(() {\n          final item = items.removeAt(oldIndex);\n          items.insert(newIndex, item);\n        });\n      },\n    );\n  }\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4571217958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4574122886","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4574122886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4574122886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABEKOThg","user":{"login":"kwhite-sdi","id":128485412,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6iIJA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128485412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi","html_url":"https://github.com/kwhite-sdi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwhite-sdi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T10:54:14Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T10:54:14Z","body":"Unfortunately, even with the alternative workaround the error still persists.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4574122886/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4574330985","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4574330985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4574330985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABEKbAaQ","user":{"login":"davidhicks980","id":59215665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjE1NjY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59215665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980","html_url":"https://github.com/davidhicks980","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidhicks980/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:21:30Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:21:30Z","body":"I was also able to get it to throw just now. Sorry about the trouble... I'll see if I can find another potential work around. I realize fixing the issue at the OverlayPortal level is the best solution, but it's nontrivial, so it'd be best to find a way around it in the meantime. Alternatively, Tooltip could be reverted, but that doesn't fix the underlying problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4574330985/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/4607410033","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/187162#issuecomment-4607410033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/187162","id":4607410033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABEp9_cQ","user":{"login":"Piinks","id":16964204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16964204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks","html_url":"https://github.com/Piinks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Piinks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T22:11:15Z","updated_at":"202